&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Skilled in crafting slide decks and written pitch materials&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
